// Baked visual assets for the deck theme — generated, not hand-written.
//
// 🔴 WHY IMAGES AT ALL: pptxgenjs has no gradient fill, and PowerPoint has no CSS — the
// gradient art that makes a deck read as designed has to arrive as pixels. These were
// rendered from SVG at build time (1280x720 JPEG for backgrounds, 96px PNG for icons) and
// baked as data URIs so deck building needs no network and no storage bucket.
//
// 🔴 THE ICONS ARE LUCIDE (ISC licence) — the icon set the product already ships in its UI —
// rasterised in two inks. PNG rather than SVG because PowerPoint's SVG support is uneven
// across versions and Google Slides import drops SVGs silently.
//
// 🔴 THIS MODULE IS HEAVY (~250KB) AND MUST ONLY EVER BE IMPORTED LAZILY — see deck-pptx.ts,
// whose builder does a dynamic import of this file. A static import anywhere in the
// app shell would put every byte of this into the first page load.

export const DECK_BG_COVER = "data:image/jpeg;base64,";
export const DECK_BG_SECTION = "data:image/jpeg;base64,";
export const DECK_BG_CLOSING = "data:image/jpeg;base64,";

